{"capability_id":"CAP-001","statement":"在新案例中区分 FDE、售前、咨询、驻场外包和平台工程，并以生产代码所有权、客户嵌入、端到端结果责任和产品回流说明判断。","observable_evidence":["对五种相邻角色完成职责矩阵，并为两个边界案例作出有理由的归类"],"knowledge_type":"concept","cognitive_process":"analyze","required_evidence_types":["independent_application","transfer"],"source_refs":["SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-005","SRC-009"],"goal_ref":"GOAL-forward-deployed-engineer-v1","created_by_event_id":"EVT-20260804T111952Z-s1-007"}
{"capability_id":"CAP-002","statement":"把模糊客户诉求转化为可验证的高价值问题，定义现场观察、基线、价值指标、干系人和停止条件。","observable_evidence":["针对未见客户情境提交问题筛选与价值假设，说明排除至少一个伪需求的依据"],"knowledge_type":"procedure","cognitive_process":"create","required_evidence_types":["independent_application","transfer"],"source_refs":["SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-006"],"goal_ref":"GOAL-forward-deployed-engineer-v1","created_by_event_id":"EVT-20260804T111952Z-s1-007"}
{"capability_id":"CAP-003","statement":"设计能在真实企业约束中验证价值的最小可行部署，并处理数据、评估、安全、集成、范围、速度和质量取舍。","observable_evidence":["为未见场景给出 2–6 周部署方案、验收集、风险控制和回滚/停止条件"],"knowledge_type":"strategy","cognitive_process":"create","required_evidence_types":["independent_application","transfer"],"source_refs":["SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-006","SRC-010"],"goal_ref":"GOAL-forward-deployed-engineer-v1","created_by_event_id":"EVT-20260804T111952Z-s1-007"}
